From: KevinXu07 <im2evenx40702@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:54:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: Add Realme

Add a vendor prefix for Realme, a smartphone maker. The Realme GT7 Pro
(RMX5010) uses it for its board compatible.

Written with an AI coding assistant (Claude), which drafted the entry
and the commit message.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: KevinXu07 <im2evenx40702@qq.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
index 1eab5c5f9..e675c498e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -1411,6 +1411,8 @@ patternProperties:
     description: Raystar Optronics, Inc.
   "^rda,.*":
     description: Unisoc Communications, Inc.
+  "^realme,.*":
+    description: Realme Chongqing Mobile Telecommunications Corp., Ltd.
   "^realtek,.*":
     description: Realtek Semiconductor Corp.
   "^relfor,.*":
